Subject: 0030-weight-copy-overlap
Weight copy / compute overlap for the offloaded Z-Image run. Bundles the staging pool (SD_STAGING_POOL_MB), the prefetch worker thread (SD_PREFETCH_THREAD), the step-wrap prefetch (SD_PREFETCH_WRAP), the pre-evict step (SD_STAGING_PREEVICT) and the pinned ring (SD_STAGING_PINNED, SD_STAGING_PINNED_MB, SD_STAGING_VERIFY). All default off: with the variables unset the stock path runs. The released scripts set SD_PREFETCH_THREAD=1 SD_STAGING_PINNED=1 SD_STAGING_PINNED_MB=64.

